# Everything a run writes: ledgers, checkpoints, artifacts, and recordings. All of it belongs to
# one machine's attempt at one run. The replay fixture that ships is tracked where it ships from,
# in src/in_lockstep/cassettes/ — tracking a working copy here as well would be two versions of
# one artifact, drifting apart.
